{"ticker":"CAT","updated":"2026-11-13T22:51:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Caterpillar Inc.","shortName":"Caterpillar, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.caterpillar.com","fullTimeEmployees":118000,"marketCap":274648023040,"trailingPE":23.55573,"forwardPE":18.652845,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.531406,"pegRatio":1.05,"targetMeanPrice":823.4139,"targetHighPrice":1044.68,"targetLowPrice":575.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.173,"earningsGrowth":0.461,"grossMargins":0.29542,"operatingMargins":0.18761,"profitMargins":0.15212,"totalRevenue":77772996608,"beta":1.64,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1073.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":537.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.08},"summary":"Caterpillar Inc. provides construction and mining equipment, off-highway diesel and natural gas engines, industrial gas turbines, and diesel-electric locomotives in the United States and internationally. The Construction Industries segment offers asphalt pavers, cold planers, compactors, forestry machines, material handlers, motor graders, pipelayers, road reclaimers, telehandlers, track-type tractors, and track and wheel excavators; backhoe, compact track, skid steer, track-type, and wheel loaders; and related parts and work tools. Its Resource Industries segment provides electric rope and hydraulic shovels, draglines, rotary drills, hard rock vehicles, mining trucks, wheel loaders, off-highway and articulated trucks, wide-body trucks, wheel tractor scrapers and dozers, and landfill and soil compactors; machinery components, and wear and maintenance components; and technology products and services for fleet management, equipment management analytics, autonomous machine capabilities, safety services, and mining performance solutions. The Energy & Transportation segment offers reciprocating engine powered generator sets; reciprocating engines, drivetrain, and integrated systems and solutions; centrifugal gas compressors and related services; and diesel-electric locomotive components, and other rail-related products. Its Financial Products segment provides operating and finance l","summary_zh":"Caterpillar Inc. 在美國和國際上提供建築和採礦設備、非公路柴油和天然氣發動機、工業燃氣渦輪機以及柴電機車。建築行業部門提供瀝青攤舖機、冷鉋機、壓實機、林業機械、物料搬運機、平地機、舖管機、道路回收機、伸縮臂叉裝機、履帶式拖拉機以及履帶式和輪式挖掘機；反鏟裝載機、緊湊型履帶式裝載機、滑移轉向裝載機、履帶式裝載機和輪式裝載機；以及相關零件和作業機具。其資源工業部門提供電繩索和液壓鏟、拉鏟、旋轉鑽機、硬岩車輛、礦用卡車、輪式裝載機、非公路和鉸接式卡車、寬體卡車、輪式拖拉機鏟運機和推土機以及垃圾掩埋場和土壤壓實機；機械部件、磨損和維護部件；以及用於車隊管理、設備管理分析、自主機器功能解決方案、採礦和維修服務、獨立機器功能解決方案。能源與運輸部門提供往復式發動機驅動的發電機組；往復式發動機、傳動系統以及集成系統和解決方案；離心式氣體壓縮機及相關服務；和柴油電力機車部件以及其他鐵路相關產品。其金融產品部門提供營運和融資服務","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"農業和重型工程機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":433.83,"h":438.75,"l":430.61,"c":435.94,"v":2255800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":436.13,"h":440.8,"l":434.28,"c":440.67,"v":2366300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":445.0,"h":452.34,"l":443.0,"c":450.66,"v":4512200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":450.96,"h":467.71,"l":448.87,"c":466.96,"v":4331900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":470.26,"h":472.12,"l":462.71,"c":466.54,"v":5069300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":467.31,"h":473.24,"l":459.61,"c":472.1,"v":3180000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":473.26,"h":485.34,"l":468.19,"c":471.26,"v":3856600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":472.7,"h":476.52,"l":468.63,"c":469.79,"v":2776700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":464.71,"h":468.0,"l":459.58,"c":463.72,"v":2979200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":465.48,"h":468.45,"l":462.38,"c":465.76,"v":2329000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":468.08,"h":472.49,"l":467.46,"c":471.61,"v":2892100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":471.62,"h":477.44,"l":470.24,"c":477.15,"v":2315300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":474.01,"h":483.93,"l":471.14,"c":480.82,"v":2964700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":486.86,"h":495.98,"l":484.19,"c":490.57,"v":2648600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":493.25,"h":504.48,"l":492.53,"c":497.85,"v":2996500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":500.42,"h":505.59,"l":493.04,"c":495.38,"v":2629200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":497.93,"h":498.38,"l":483.55,"c":486.71,"v":2135400}